  "sourceTitle": "Luncheon Meat",
  "sourceText": "Luncheon Meat\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, January 1, 2010 - 12:13am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 lbs. hamburger\n1 cup water\n2 teaspoons liquid smoke\n1 teaspoon mustard seed\n2 1/2 tablespoons Tender Quick\n1/2 teaspoon pepper\n1/4 teaspoon garlic powder\n1/2 teaspoon onion powder\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix well and form into 3 rolls. Put into aluminum foil and refrigerate overnight. Punch holes in bottom of foil and place on rack in pan. Bake 1 1/4 hours at 350 degrees.",
